  "heading": "Establishment and regulation of air force prisons.",
  "chapter": null,
  "order": 173,
  "text": "The Central Government may set apart any building or part of a building, or any place under its control, as an air force prison or detention barracks for the confinement of persons sentenced to imprisonment or detention under this Act.",
